/**
 * SLAY — the extra lines every unique and set piece carries.
 *
 * Each item's own fixed list, on top of the lines written with it: the same
 * stats on every drop, with values rolled inside the range written here.
 * Every list was chosen by hand to suit its item: only lines its slot can
 * hold, in keeping with its name, story and power (a burning blade adds to
 * its fire, a tower shield to its guard, a miser's ring to its finds), never
 * a stat it already has written, and no two items share the same set. A
 * caster's weapon takes no attack rating or attack speed. Values are the top
 * rung of each affix ladder at the item's own item level. Owned items take
 * these lines when the save loads (`refreshFixedLines` in sim/Loot.ts).
 * Edit any entry freely; nothing regenerates this file.
 */

